# Playwright Baseline Snapshots
# This directory will contain baseline screenshots generated by Playwright visual regression tests.
# 
# To generate baseline snapshots:
# 1. Install Playwright: npx playwright install --with-deps chromium
# 2. Run tests with update flag: npm run test:e2e:baseline
# 3. Commit the generated .png files
#
# The first CI run of the visual job will generate these snapshots automatically.
# After that, commit them to the repo so subsequent runs compare against them.
